<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>化学 - 分类 - ∅AxiomLab</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/</link><description>∅AxiomLab</description><generator>Hugo 0.162.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 14:57:36 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Perkin 反应</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/chemistry/organic/perkin-reaction/</link><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 14:57:36 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/chemistry/organic/perkin-reaction/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/">化学</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在碱性催化剂的作用下，&lt;strong&gt;芳香醛&lt;/strong&gt;与&lt;strong&gt;酸酐&lt;/strong&gt;反应生成 β-芳基-α,β-不饱和羧酸，这一反应称为 &lt;strong&gt;Perkin 反应&lt;/strong&gt;。所用碱性催化剂通常是与酸酐相对应的羧酸盐。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/chemistry/organic/perkin-reaction/image.png' alt="Perkin 反应通式" height="157" width="992"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2026北京化学预选赛</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/chemistry/competition/2026-beijing-preliminary/</link><pubDate>Sun, 19 Apr 2026 17:12:05 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/chemistry/competition/2026-beijing-preliminary/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/">化学</category><description>&lt;p&gt;2026 年高中化学奥林匹克北京地区预选赛,没有难绷的元素推断,全是&lt;strong&gt;化学基本理论&lt;/strong&gt;的运用与&lt;strong&gt;热力学计算&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>